<title>USA: Cable Link sets 3-for-2 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Cable Link sets 3-for-2 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cable Link Inc said Tuesday it declared a three-for-two stock dividend, payable on January 31 to common shareholders of record January 21.</p>
<p>The company said the purpose of the dividend is to &quot;increase the number of shareholders with the expectation of a more efficient market for the purchase and sale of Cable Link shares.&quot;</p>
